url: "https://github.com/NavisWORLD/cosmic-synapse-A-lmi-v.2"
abstract: >-
  Research-oriented persistent AI runtime and preserved research lineage. The
  active product separates user-owned memory, computational state, provenance,
  routing, artifacts/knowledge surfaces, and authority from replaceable model
  providers; it includes deterministic portable continuity tooling, A-LMI data
  structures and optional multimodal/infrastructure integrations, CST software
  state/replay, HRCS communications research, God Music, Unity IPC source, and
  preserved historical theory/publication artifacts.
